{"t":"MKC","n":"McCormick & Company, Incorporated","nKo":"맥코믹 앤 컴퍼니(McCormick & Company)","ex":"NYSE","cur":"USD","px":47.87,"chg":0.47,"chgPct":0.00992,"prev":47.4,"dayH":47.95,"dayL":46.15,"w52H":72.41,"w52L":43.25,"vol":3874120,"avgVol":4099640,"mcap":12880116736,"pe":8.66,"fpe":14.89,"eps":5.53,"feps":3.21,"pb":1.84,"div":2.04,"divY":0.0426,"beta":0.67,"short":2455,"shortPct":null,"shortRatio":0.0,"prof":{"c":"United States","cKo":"미국","s":"Consumer Defensive","sKo":"소비자 방어","i":"Packaged Foods","iKo":"포장식품","city":"Hunt Valley","emp":14100,"web":"https://www.mccormickcorporation.com","sum":"McCormick & Company, Incorporated manufactures, markets, and distributes herbs, spices, seasoning mixes, condiments, and other flavorful products to the food industry. It operates in two segments, Consumer and Flavor Solutions. The Consumer segment offers spices, herbs, and seasonings, as well as condiments, sauces, and desserts. This segment markets its products under the McCormick, French's, Frank's RedHot, Lawry's, Cholula Hot Sauce, Club House, Gourmet Garden, and OLD BAY brands in the Americas; Ducros, Schwartz, Kamis, LA Drogheria, and Vahiné brands in Europe, the Middle East, and Africa; and McCormick and DaQiao brands in the Asia/Pacific (APAC), as well as desserts under the Aeroplane brand; and packaged chilled herbs under the Gourmet Garden brand. Its authentic regional brands in","sumKo":"McCormick & Company, Incorporated는 허브, 향신료, 조미료 혼합물, 조미료 및 기타 향미 제품을 제조, 판매 및 식품 산업에 유통합니다. 소비자 솔루션과 맛 솔루션이라는 두 가지 부문으로 운영됩니다. 소비자 부문에서는 향신료, 허브, 조미료는 물론 조미료, 소스, 디저트도 제공합니다. 이 부문은 미주 지역에서 McCormick, French's, Frank's RedHot, Lawry's, Cholula Hot Sauce, Club House, Gourmet Garden 및 OLD BAY 브랜드로 제품을 판매합니다. 유럽, 중동 및 아프리카의 Ducros, Schwartz, Kamis, LA Drogheria 및 Vahiné 브랜드; 아시아/태평양(APAC)의 McCormick 및 DaQiao 브랜드와 비행기 브랜드의 디저트; Gourmet Garden 브랜드로 냉장 허브를 포장했습니다. 정통 지역 브랜드"},"fin":{"annual":[{"y":2022,"rev":6350500000,"ni":682000000},{"y":2023,"rev":6662200000,"ni":680600000},{"y":2024